{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file provides a Linux kernel driver implementation for accessing switch registers via the Switch Register Access Bridge (SRAB) hardware component. It includes definitions, macros, and functions for requesting grants, releasing grants, and performing read/write operations (8, 16, 32, 48, 64-bit) on switch registers. It also contains code for probing and removing the driver, and setting up platform data and driver registration.", "external_files": ["<linux/kernel.h>", "<linux/module.h>", "<linux/platform_device.h>", "<linux/platform_data/b53.h>", "b53_priv.h"], "external_methods": ["readl", "writel", "usleep_range", "WARN_ON", "platform_set_drvdata", "platform_get_drvdata"], "published": ["b53_srab_probe", "b53_srab_remove"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "int b53_srab_request_grant(struct b53_device * dev)", "description": "Requests a grant for register access from the Switch Register Access Bridge.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void b53_srab_release_grant(struct b53_device * dev)", "description": "Releases the previously acquired grant for register access.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_op(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u32 op)", "description": "Performs an operation (read/write) on a switch register at a specific page and register address.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read8(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u8 * val)", "description": "Reads an 8-bit value from a switch register.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read16(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u16 * val)", "description": "Reads a 16-bit value from a switch register.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read32(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u32 * val)", "description": "Reads a 32-bit value from a switch register.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read48(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 re